    "user correction of a rule/protocol/source interpretation",
    "ambiguous reference/example intent",
    "known working JSON exists but was not checked before generation/correction",
    "script output conflicts with run_gate or JSON evidence gate",
    "visual/screenshot evidence contradicts generated intent",
    "assistant realizes it skipped a required bundle",
    "assembled subsystem appears disconnected, floating, unsupported, or lacks connection proof",
    "known feature variant requested but control recipe/signature was not loaded",
    "JSON was recreated exactly but part-role/relationship/adaptation ledgers were not extracted",
    "claimed prior JSON-derived knowledge is missing from recipe/signature files",
    "NMS build-language prompt routed to image generation without explicit visual-output request",
    "part behavior/style-transfer request proceeded without request trace and locked objectives",
    "source behavior/control fitment was replaced by generic geometry or optimization assumptions",
    "claimed learning/proof lacks derived invariant or PART_BEHAVIOR_SIGNATURE evidence",
    "part behavior learning response claims durable knowledge but library/part_placement_maps was not updated or loaded",
    "PART_BEHAVIOR_SIGNATURE exists but no PART_PLACEMENT_MAP storage receipt exists",
    "local frames were not computed from source Position/Up/At before deriving fitment rules",
    "protocol banner missing source docs rev, bundle, gate, ambiguity, or Docs Avail field",
    "complex focal build has no GEOMETRY_CONSTRUCTION_PLAN",
    "single-part surface build is generated from centroid scatter instead of edge/curve/surface graph",
    "Blender build script lacks real bpy/BUILDER runtime placement path",
    "three or more objective failures occur without protocol/gate update before next variant",
    "known feature terms detected but FEATURE_RECIPE_LOOKUP is missing or malformed",
